      <figure class="bm-1col-media__image"><img src="/media/placeholder.svg" alt="image" loading="lazy" width="900" height="600" /></figure>
    </div>
    <div class="bm-portfolio-single__case-section-1">
      <div class="bm-portfolio-single-intro-inline">
        <h2 class="bm-portfolio-single-intro-inline__heading">The Solution</h2>
        <p class="bm-portfolio-single-intro-inline__text">Based on the research, PixelPundits developed a multi-pronged digital marketing strategy:</p>
      </div>
